<body lang=EN-US link="#0563C1" vlink="#954F72">
 <div class=WordSection1>
 <p class=MsoNormal>Hello {!Opportunity.OwnerFullName},<o:p></o:p></p>
 <p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
 <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:14.65pt;vertical-align:baseline'>
 <span style='color:black'>The opportunity referenced in the subject line is <b>no longer on hold.</b><o:p></o:p></span>
  </p><br/>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:14.65pt;vertical-align:baseline'>
 <span style='color:black'>Open the opportunity in Sales CRM to continue in the business process and review any regulatory compliance requirements that may apply to this opportunity<o:p></o:p></span>
  </p><br/>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:14.65pt;vertical-align:baseline'>
 <span style='color:black'>If you have questions or concerns about the MINDS review:
<o:p></o:p></span>
  </p>
 <p class=MsoListParagraph style='text-indent:-.25in;line-height:14.65pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;vertical-align:baseline'>
 <![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:Wingdings'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>&Oslash;<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span></span></span>
 <![endif]>Intel opportunity owners contact <a href="mailto:export.customer@intel.com">export.customer@intel.com</a><o:p></o:p>
 
 </p>
 <p class=MsoListParagraph style='text-indent:-.25in;line-height:14.65pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;vertical-align:baseline'>
 <![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:Wingdings'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>&Oslash;<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span></span></span>
 <![endif]>Non-Intel opportunity owners contact your Intel counterpart or review resources <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/distributor/ddr-training/mag.html">here</a>
 <o:p></o:p>
 </p>
 <p class=MsoNormal><span style='color:#1F497D'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
 <p class=MsoNormal>Thank you,<o:p></o:p></p>
 <p class=MsoNormal><span style='color:black'> Intel Global Export </span>Compliance<o:p></o:p></p>
 <p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
 <p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
 </div>
